{"name": "Sons of God — Arise", "tagline": "Creation is waiting for you.", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "folder": "sons-of-god-arise", "icon": "", "iconAlt": "", "sharePicture": "", "shareAlt": "", "searchTitle": "", "searchDescription": "", "keyPhrases": "", "pages": [{"id": "p-home", "title": "Home", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "sections": [{"id": "s-home-contents", "tabName": "Contents", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-home-story", "tabName": "Home", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-kk06ndy", "name": "Home Page", "paragraphs": [{"id": "r-3v542le", "columns": [{"id": "1", "rowId": "r-3v542le", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787667510996, "title": "", "text": "\"Creation eagerly awaits the revealing of the sons of God\"\n\n<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Rom 8:19-21\">Rom 8:19-21</a>", "width": 1, "format": "Text Middle", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "format": {"columnText": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "20", "color": "#1b3a4b", "background": "", "borderColor": "", "borderWidth": "", "sides": {"t": true, "r": true, "b": true, "l": true}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowColor": "#ffffff", "padding": "", "marginTop": "", "marginBottom": "", "align": "center", "lineHeight": "1.2", "paraGap": "3"}}, "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Text Left"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-7xst2ia", "columns": [{"id": "2", "rowId": "r-7xst2ia", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787681665954, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/sons-of-god-watching.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0 0px 0\" />", "width": 1, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "39", "rowId": "r-7xst2ia", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787681981227, "title": "", "text": "Have you ever wondered why this is our destiny in Christ?\nThe same phrase appeared far earlier, when the sons of God watched God lay the earth’s foundations.\n\nSo why does creation still need you — and what critical role were you created to play?", "width": 1, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "format": {"columnText": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "18", "color": "#1b3a4b", "background": "", "borderColor": "", "borderWidth": "", "sides": {"t": true, "r": true, "b": true, "l": true}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowColor": "#00000040", "padding": "", "marginTop": "", "marginBottom": "", "align": "center", "lineHeight": "1.45", "paraGap": "18"}}, "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Text Middle"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0, "title": ""}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-home-intro", "tabName": "Introduction", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-sd2vs8k", "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true, "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatNames": {"website": "Default", "pageTitle": "Default"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "p-created", "title": "God wanted to dwell with Human Beings", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "sections": [{"id": "s-p2-contents", "tabName": "Contents", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-story", "tabName": "Story", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-0uox0cu", "name": "Sons of God — Arise", "paragraphs": [{"id": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "20", "rowId": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640414, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/Image-1-e1759421906895.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0 0px 0\" />", "width": 1, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}]}, {"id": "r-usw9juf", "columns": [{"id": "3", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640414, "title": "", "text": "Before everything existed, Yahweh wanted to dwell with a human family in the garden of Eden.<span class=\"fn\"> </span> Love would be the only language spoken in His presence.<span class=\"fn\">1</span>\n\nGod, whose name is Yahweh, planned to fill Eden with human beings to cover the whole earth.<span class=\"fn\">2</span> Eden becomes the Paradise of God when heaven and earth come together, with the Tree of Life.<span class=\"fn\">3</span>", "width": 347.453125, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "4", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Eph 1:3-6\">Eph 1:3-6</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\"></span>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:26\"> Gen 1:26</a>\n\n3 <span class=\"fn\">3</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Rev 2:7\"> Rev 2:7</a>", "width": 80.5625, "format": "Text Middle", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-8c2ynq6", "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "5", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "However, there is something not mentioned in that account.  When Yahweh was creating the earth, the sons of God were rejoicing - spiritual beings who watched from heaven.<span class=\"fn\">1</span> The sons of God dwell with God in heaven and minister here on earth. <span class=\"fn\">2</span>  \n\nGod's plan is to dwell with both His human and spiritual families in Paradise on earth, forever. <span class=\"fn\">3</span> \n\n<span class=\"fn\"></span>", "width": 352.015625, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "6", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Job 38:4-7\">Job 38:4-7</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Heb 1:14\">Heb 1:14</a>\n\n <span class=\"fn\">3</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"1Co 6:2-3\">1Co 6:2-3</a>", "width": 80, "format": "Text Middle", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-jhfhiie", "columns": [{"id": "7", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/garden-of-eden-adam-eve-tree-of-life.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\" />", "width": 160, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "8", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "Yahweh planted a garden for Adam and Eve, called Eden, the Paradise of God, where they walked with Him. The tree of life was in the midst of the garden and everything was very good.", "width": 687, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "31", "order": 4, "editedAt": 0, "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "32", "rowId": "31", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "Yahweh had chosen to start with one couple, and their descendants would fill the earth - every one of them created in His image.<span class=\"fn\">2</span> Yahweh gave each one the opportunity to serve as His ambassador, tending and keeping His garden.<span class=\"fn\">2</span>", "width": 496, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "35", "rowId": "31", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\"></span><span class=\"fn\"></span><span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:27\"><span class=\"fn\">1</span> Gen 1:27</a>-28\">Gen 1:27-28</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Isa 55:11\">Isa 55:11\n</a>", "width": 107.8125, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}]}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-qa", "tabName": "Q&A", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-xa3eto1", "name": "Eden’s Symbolism", "paragraphs": [{"id": "r-fgx6ojv", "columns": [{"id": "9", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 119, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "10", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "Let US make MANKIND in our image", "text": "Does ‘mankind’ mean the whole human race? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 727, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-tscdkju", "columns": [{"id": "11", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 121, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "12", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787646640415, "title": "", "text": "Let US make MANKIND in our image Does ‘man’ mean Adam or mankind? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 725, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-b7wst1g", "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true, "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatNames": {"website": "Default", "pageTitle": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}], "siteFormat": {"website": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "22", "color": "#1f6f78", "background": "#f6f7eb", "borderColor": "#c5d0d4", "borderWidth": "1", "sides": {"t": false, "r": false, "b": false, "l": false}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowColor": "#00000040", "padding": "0", "marginTop": "0", "marginBottom": "0", "align":